# Weather

Narrative and code map: [docs/weather.md](../../docs/weather.md). Read it before changing this area.

## Must preserve

- Client-direct Open-Meteo only — no weather snapshot in git, no API key.
- Fetch and show only on network tier `full`; light = no request, no chrome.
- Soft-fail to nothing; never block Come arrivare; never call `markLight()` for weather.
- Show CC BY credit whenever weather is visible (`https://open-meteo.com/`).
- Vendor only Meteocons **monochrome** SVGs under `static/images/weather/` (MIT LICENSE); paint via CSS mask/`currentColor`, not fill art or per-condition backdrops.
- Use `baglioLocation` courtyard coords; keep CSP `connect-src` including `https://api.open-meteo.com`.
- Unit tests use fixtures — no live Open-Meteo in CI.
